    "sub_name": "英語會話與溝通",
    "sub_ename": "ENGLISH CONVERSATION AND COMMUNICATION",
    "describe_ch": "提升學生的口語表達技能。透過不同主題與情境的溝通模式，學生將能學習到和各主題情境相關的知識、用語和溝通目的。\r\n",
    "describe_eh": "This course is aimed at improving students’ verbal communication skills in a number of communication settings. Through a variety of topics and settings, they are expected to gain insights into relevant expressions and knowledge. More importantly, they will further their understanding of the purpose of verbal communication using English as a channel.\r\n",
